_ do inferred-args ImmutableArray'TypeId'ArenaBacking
    - scope MatchScope
    - module ModuleId
    - decl DeclId
    - receiver TypeId
    - signature Signature

` What a generic candidate's arguments are under what the call's arguments have bound of its
` type parameters, as the reference evaluates each argument's type in the scope it inferred
` before it compares the argument to it. A parameter nothing has bound stays a variable.
. mark = scratch.types.mark
for offset in 0 .. < signature.params.length
    . held = relations.scope-lookup(scope, signature.params[offset])
    scratch.types.push(held ?? signature.variables[offset])
. arguments = TypeArguments(signature.params, scratch.types.since(mark))
= signature-into(types, module, decl, arguments, receiver, true).args

